# A fork where the narration says "either". Expected: ACTIVITY-PARALLEL-VS-EXCLUSIVE (major).
diagram activity
id refund-fork
title After a return is checked, the customer gets one of two outcomes
narration Once the return is checked, the customer either gets a refund or gets store credit.

start begin
action check "check return"
fork split
action refund "issue refund"
action credit "issue store credit"
join merge-bar
end done

begin -> check
check -> split
split -> refund
split -> credit
refund -> merge-bar
credit -> merge-bar
merge-bar -> done
